  Hello everyone,

  I'm having a strange problem with console on my Miata (PWS500a). Everything 
was OK until I ran Xconfigurator and chose a high resolution. I saw an X
picture, but when I returned to console, the screen was messed up on all the
virtual consoles. I thought reboot will help, but it didn't - I could see
everything come up and then all of a sudden I had the console screen messed up
again (while still in text mode). I can type commands there, 
can start X (comes up ok), can login remotely, but when in text console mode, 
all I see is different color boxes instead of letters, cursor and a background.
I wonder if anyone experience that before and can help me fix this. 

  Thanks,


                                      Arc C.
