On Mon, Jul 07, 2003 at 04:44:36PM +0200, Romain Guerout wrote:
>
> Finally I have installed RH 7.2 on my miata (Badly burnt CDs. Damned
> Windows !!!).

:-)

> The problem I have now is that it does not want to start the X server
> When I run Xconfigurator, I find my graphic card (Cirrus Logic GD 543x)
> and my monitor (Digital PCXBV-KA)
> but when I run startx, I have
> # *** none of the configured devices were detected ***
> # No screen found
> or something like this ...

If the card is a real Cirrus (not like some DEC cards like TGA2 that
have a Cirrus on them to handle text console mode), then you may be
out of luck, as Cirrus support on Alpha has been weak, if not
non-existent, until the latest (4.3.0?) revision of XFree86...

Try to find a different card, like a Permedia-2 based card, or a Matrox
Millennium of some flavor, both of which are well supported.

Good luck.

 --Jay++

