3D works on 9000 and 9100, however untested with PCI hardware,
and also untested with Alpha.  For those that aren't aware, the
Radeon PCI DRI support however was developed originally for Alpha
of course, and worked only on Alpha until recently when PCI
posting bugs were fixed which didn't seem to affect alpha.

